 "quest": {
  "id": "caravan_first_blood",
  "intro": "Fear an Bhealaigh tells of a crooked train of carts hauling plunder along the old roads, guarded by raiders. Find one, break its escort, and open the strongbox.",
  "links_to": [
   "relics_nemesis",
   "arms_bronze_age",
   "global_events_log"
  ]
 },
 "java_notes": "Needs a server-side caravan controller: spawn scheduler with cooldown, leader path-following and follower leashing of cart entities to mounts, despawn timer, Age-scaled escort loadouts read from the scoreboard, bad-omen banner death hook, the caravan_detect_range and caravan_loot_bonus attributes, client entity renderers, and Global Events plus Codex registration."
}